    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Tamellat, Morocco - March 31st, 2012: Two men pushing car, small bus and truck waiting to cross the flooded country road in the background, people watching; after heavy rain in the desert, northern Africa.</rdf:li>
