   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Fishermans boats in Essaouira, city in the western Morocco, on the Atlantic coast. It has also been known by its Portuguese name of Mogador. Morocco, north Africa. NikonD3x</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
